Theorem RL-18a: VM and compiled plans erase to one AIMS trace

  Preconditions:
    - One AllocationFacts product and ExtentClass are frozen.
    - VmLayoutPlan and CompiledLayoutPlan independently select mechanisms.
    - Both plans satisfy the exact same logical contract.

  Soundness property:
    Forall validated VM plan V and compiled plan C:

      (P1) vmPlanTrace(V) = aimsTrace(facts).

      (P2) compiledPlanTrace(C) = aimsTrace(facts).

      (P3) vmPlanTrace(V) = compiledPlanTrace(C).

      (P4) P3 holds even when V and C use different physical mechanisms.

  Proof obligation:
    Constructive Satisfies checks for both plans followed by exact trace
    equality over OwnershipObservationFacts and CleanupObligation.

    Part (P1/P2/P3/P4) - projection parity:
      validated VM plan -> satisfies
      validated compiled plan -> satisfies
      VM trace = exact AIMS trace = compiled trace
      mechanisms differ -> permitted
      Coverage gate: 4 projection cases.

    Engines dispatched:
      case_analysis (PRIMARY - section_08::verify_rl18a_projection_parity;
        projection_refines_aims_trace and vm_compiled_event_parity)
      rc_counting (SECONDARY - gracious-accept per the coverage-manifest RL row)
      refinement (SECONDARY - gracious-accept per the coverage-manifest RL row)

  Expected:
    status: valid
    reason: section_08 case_analysis engine discharges RL-18a because independently selected VM and compiled mechanisms satisfy one contract and vmPlanTrace equals compiledPlanTrace exactly
